OL,9,G2000 The Briefing Room
OL,10,     FAs government prepares for yet
OL,11,     Fanother new prime minister, it is
OL,12,     Fkeenly aware that this one is keen
OL,13,     Fon moving power away from the
OL,14,     Fcentre to the English regions.
OL,15,     FWill it work?
OL,16,G2030 BBC Inside Science
OL,17,     FWhat's the point of having a
OL,18,     Ftreaty banning nuclear weapons in
OL,19,     Fspace if we can't spot them?
